repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/9580", "id": 4323779267, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G88AAAABAbeiww", "user": {"login": "alt-glitch", "id": 52913345, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjUyOTEzMzQ1", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52913345?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/alt-glitch", "html_url": "https://github.com/alt-glitch", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alt-glitch/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alt-glitch/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alt-glitch/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alt-glitch/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alt-glitch/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alt-glitch/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alt-glitch/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alt-glitch/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alt-glitch/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-04-27T02:27:10Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-27T02:27:10Z", "body": "Azure AI Foundry provider support was merged in #15845 with auto-detection. If you're on the latest version, you can configure it via `hermes setup` \u2014 it should auto-detect the `ANTHROPIC_FOUNDRY_BASE_URL` env var. The Foundry-specific env vars (`CLAUDE_CODE_USE_FOUNDRY`, `ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_OPUS_MODEL`, `ANTHROPIC_MODEL`) are Claude Code-specific and not used by Hermes. Instead, set `provider: azure-foundry` in your config or let auto-detection handle it. See also #10213 for related discussion.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4323779267/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4668317982", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/9580#issuecomment-4668317982", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/9580", "id": 4668317982, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G88AAAABFkDhHg", "user": {"login": "teknium1", "id": 127238744, "node_id": "U_kgDOB5WCWA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127238744?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1", "html_url": "https://github.com/teknium1", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-06-10T08:51:13Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-10T08:51:13Z", "body": "<!-- hermes-sweeper:item=9580 -->\n<!-- hermes-sweeper:verdict=close reason=implemented_on_main confidence=high -->\nAzure AI Foundry support landed in PR #15845 and is available on the latest version of Hermes Agent.\n\n- **Provider registered:** `azure-foundry` is a first-class provider in `hermes_cli/auth.py` with `AZURE_FOUNDRY_API_KEY` and `AZURE_FOUNDRY_BASE_URL` env vars.\n- **Setup wizard:** `hermes model` \u2192 select \"Azure Foundry\" \u2192 enter endpoint URL + API key. The wizard auto-detects the transport (OpenAI-style vs Anthropic-style) and prefills a picker with your deployed model IDs.\n- **Anthropic/Claude endpoints:** URLs ending in `/anthropic` (like `https://xxx.services.ai.azure.com/anthropic/`) are auto-recognised and routed via the Anthropic Messages API format \u2014 no manual config needed.\n- **Docs:** `website/docs/guides/azure-foundry.md` has the full Quick Start and env var reference.\n- **Claude Code-specific vars** (`CLAUDE_CODE_USE_FOUNDRY`, `ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_OPUS_MODEL`, `ANTHROPIC_MODEL`, `ANTHROPIC_FOUNDRY_*`) are not used by Hermes \u2014 use `AZURE_FOUNDRY_API_KEY` / `AZURE_FOUNDRY_BASE_URL` instead, or let `hermes setup` configure them interactively.\n\nClosing as implemented. This is an automated hermes-sweeper review; see also the MEMBER comment from @alt-glitch above for further context.\n", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4668317982/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}]